{'symbol': 'TDG', 'date': '2021-06-30 16:15:00', 'title': 'TRANSDIGM COMPLETES DIVESTITURE OF SCIOTEQ AND TREALITY BUSINESSES', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, JUNE 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRANSDIGM GROUP INCORPORATED (NYSE: TDG), A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER, PRODUCER AND SUPPLIER OF HIGHLY ENGINEERED AIRCRAFT COMPONENTS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE DIVESTITURE OF ITS SCIOTEQ AND TREALITY SIMULATION VISUAL SYSTEMS BUSINESSES (COLLECTIVELY, "THE BUSINESSES") TO OPENGATE CAPITAL IN A TRANSACTION VALUED AT APPROXIMATELY $200 MILLION. SCIOTEQ AND TREALITY WERE ACQUIRED BY TRANSDIGM IN MARCH 2019 AS PART OF THE ESTERLINE TECHNOLOGIES ACQUISITION.'}